### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/console
@token = your_auth_token_here
@ticketId = ticket-uuid-here

### Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets?page=1&limit=20&queue=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ticket detail (with messages)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create ticket (staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-uuid",
  "category": "BILLING",
  "priority": "NORMAL",
  "source": "PHONE",
  "subject": "Invoice not received",
  "description": "Customer called about missing March invoice.",
  "assignedToAdminId": null
}

### Assign ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToAdminId": "admin-uuid"
}

### Reply to customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "We have resent the invoice to your registered email.",
  "isInternal": false
}

### Internal note
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Checked billing — invoice was emailed 2026-03-01.",
  "isInternal": true
}

### Update status
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### Soft delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sms/support/tickets/delete/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
